BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Travel and Expense Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-FIN-007 | Owner: Group Finance | Effective date: 1 April 2024 | Version: 1) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 676 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 654 Td (This policy sets out how Meridian Instruments Ltd employees travel on company business and how) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (they are reimbursed for reasonable expenses incurred while doing their job. It applies to all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (employees, contractors engaged through Meridian payroll and temporary staff at every Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (site: Leeds, Rotterdam, Austin and Penang.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (The principle behind the policy is simple. Spend Meridian's money as carefully as you would) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (spend your own. Choose the most economical option that still allows you to do your work safely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (and effectively, and never make or receive a claim that you would not be comfortable explaining) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (to a colleague in Finance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 529 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 507 Td (This policy covers business travel \(air, rail, road, taxis and hire cars\), hotel accommodation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 494 Td (meals and daily subsistence, client entertainment, and other out-of-pocket business costs such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 481 Td (as professional subscriptions and small purchases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459 Td (It does not cover the purchase of goods or services from suppliers, which must be raised as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (purchase requisition under the Procurement Manual \(POL-FIN-012\) and approved in line with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (Delegation of Authority and Approval Matrix \(POL-FIN-003\). Use of the Northgate Commercial Card) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (is governed by the Corporate Card Policy \(POL-FIN-009\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 395 Td (3. Before you travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 373 Td (All travel must have a clear business purpose and be agreed in advance with your line manager.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (Consider whether a video call on Teams would achieve the same result before booking a trip.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 338 Td (International travel requires a completed International Travel Pre-Approval form \(F-221\). The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 325 Td (form must be submitted at least 10 days before the planned departure date and approved by your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (budget holder. The form records the purpose of the trip, the estimated total cost and the cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 299 Td (centre to be charged. Travel booked without an approved F-221 may not be reimbursed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (Book flights, rail and hotels through the Travel module in Atlas, which connects to our travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 264 Td (management company. Step-by-step instructions are in the Travel Booking Guide. Bookings made) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (outside Atlas are only reimbursed when the Atlas option was unavailable or demonstrably more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 238 Td (expensive, and the reason must be stated on the claim.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 213 Td (4. Air travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 191 Td (Class of travel is determined by the scheduled flight time of each individual flight, not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 178 Td (total journey time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 156 Td (- Flights under 6 hours: economy class.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 143 Td (- Flights of 6 hours or more: premium economy class may be booked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 130 Td (- Flights over 10 hours: business class may be booked with prior approval from the Finance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117 Td (   Director.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (Book at least 14 days ahead where possible and choose the lowest logical fare. Seat selection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (and one checked bag are reimbursable. Airline lounge memberships are not.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 66 Td (5. Rail travel) Tj ET
endstream
