BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (Standard class is the default for all rail travel. First class may be booked where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (scheduled journey time exceeds 3 hours, or where an advance first class ticket is cheaper than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (the flexible standard fare. Railcards purchased for frequent business travel are reimbursable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (where they pay for themselves within the year.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 665 Td (6. Road travel and mileage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (Use of a private car for business travel is reimbursed per unit of distance at the rates below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 630 Td (Commuting between home and your normal place of work is not business mileage. Mileage must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (recorded on a Mileage Log \(F-207\) or entered in the mileage section of the Atlas claim, showing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (date, start point, destination, purpose and distance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 583 Td (Country | Rate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 571 Td (UK | 45p per mile, first 10,000 miles) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 559 Td (UK | 25p per mile, above 10,000 miles) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 547 Td (Netherlands | \2000.21 per km) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 535 Td (United States | $0.67 per mile) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 523 Td (Malaysia | RM 0.80 per km) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 501 Td (Employees who receive a car allowance under the Company Car and Car Allowance Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 488 Td (\(POL-FIN-015\) should follow that policy for business mileage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (Hire cars should be compact or intermediate class and booked through Atlas. Refuel before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 453 Td (returning the vehicle. Taxis and ride-hailing services are reimbursed where no reasonable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440 Td (public transport option exists, when carrying heavy equipment, or when travelling after 21:00.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 415 Td (7. Accommodation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 393 Td (Hotels should be booked through Atlas at or below the nightly cap for the city. Caps are per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 380 Td (room per night and include breakfast where offered, but exclude local tourist taxes. Where a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 367 Td (trade fair or major event means no room is available at the cap, the budget holder may approve) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 354 Td (a higher rate in advance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 329 Td (8. Per-diem and hotel caps by city) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 307 Td (The per-diem allowance covers meals and incidental expenses for a full day away from your home) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 294 Td (location with an overnight stay. On travel days where you depart after 12:00 or return before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 281 Td (12:00, half the per-diem applies. The per-diem is a cap on reimbursed actual spend supported by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268 Td (receipts, not a flat payment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 247 Td (City | Per diem \(meals\) | Hotel cap per night) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 235 Td (London | \24355 | \243180) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 223 Td (Leeds | \24340 | \243110) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 211 Td (Rotterdam | \20050 | \200150) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 199 Td (Amsterdam | \20060 | \200190) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 187 Td (Frankfurt | \20060 | \200170) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 175 Td (Austin | $60 | $210) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 163 Td (New York | $85 | $320) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 151 Td (Penang | RM 150 | RM 400) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 139 Td (Kuala Lumpur | RM 180 | RM 450) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 127 Td (Singapore | SGD 90 | SGD 320) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 105 Td (For cities not listed, use the rate for the nearest listed city in the same country, or ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 92 Td (expenses@meridian-instruments.example for guidance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 67 Td (9. Expense category limits) Tj ET
endstream
