BT /F2 9 Tf 54 730 Td (Category | Limit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 718 Td (Team meal \(manager-approved\) | \24325 per head) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 706 Td (Working-late meal \(after 20:00\) | \24315 per person) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 694 Td (Client entertainment | \24360 per head) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 682 Td (Professional subscriptions | \243300 per year) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 670 Td (Business books and publications | \243100 per year) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 658 Td (Hotel laundry \(trips over 5 nights\) | \24320 per trip) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 646 Td (Mobile roaming add-ons | actual cost, pre-agreed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 624 Td (Limits for EUR, USD and MYR claims are converted at the Group budget exchange rate. Alcohol is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 611 Td (only reimbursable as part of client entertainment and must be moderate. Client entertainment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 598 Td (must be recorded with the names and organisations of all attendees. Gifts and hospitality given) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 585 Td (to or received from third parties must also be recorded where required by the Code of Conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 572 Td (\(POL-CORP-001\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 547 Td (10. Non-reimbursable items) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 525 Td (- Fines, parking penalties and speeding tickets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (- Personal travel insurance \(Meridian provides business travel cover\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 499 Td (- In-room films, minibar and spa charges.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486 Td (- Upgrades bought with personal funds or loyalty points exchanged for cash.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473 Td (- Expenses for partners or family members.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 460 Td (- Clothing and personal grooming.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 444 Td (11. Submitting a claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (Claims are submitted in Atlas under Atlas > Expenses > New Claim. Each claim must show the cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (centre, the business purpose and, for meals and entertainment, the names of the people present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (Receipts are required for every item over \24310 \(or local equivalent\). Photographs of receipts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (uploaded to Atlas are acceptable; keep the originals until the claim is paid. Card statements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (are not a substitute for a receipt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 339 Td (Claims must be submitted within 90 days of the date the expense was incurred. Claims older than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (90 days will be rejected unless the Group Financial Controller agrees an exception.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304 Td (Reimbursement is paid through payroll. The cut-off dates for each site are published in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291 Td (payroll calendars.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 266 Td (12. Approval thresholds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (Each claim is routed for approval in Atlas according to its total value.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 223 Td (Claim total | Approver) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 211 Td (Up to \243500 | Line manager) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 199 Td (\243500.01 to \2432,500 | Budget holder) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 187 Td (Above \2432,500 | Finance Director) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 165 Td (No one may approve their own claim or a claim from someone to whom they report. Claims from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 152 Td (members of the Executive team are approved by the CFO; claims from the CFO are approved by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 139 Td (CEO.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 114 Td (13. Compliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 92 Td (Finance audits a sample of claims every month. Claims that breach this policy will be returned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 79 Td (or reduced. Deliberately false or inflated claims are treated as gross misconduct under the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 66 Td (Disciplinary and Grievance Procedure \(POL-HR-040\).) Tj ET
